  "unit": "Unit 17 - Absolute Value",
  "description": "Comprehensive lesson covering Unit 17 - Absolute Value for SAT Math preparation.",
  "duration": 45,
  "content": "<ol>\n<li><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mo>&#x02265;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math> (always nonnegative).  </li>\n<li><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo></mrow></math>.  </li>\n<li><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo></mrow></math>.  </li>\n<li><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" fence=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">&#x0007C;</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo stretchy=\"true\" fence=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">&#x0007C;</mo></mrow><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>&#x0002C;</mo><mspace width=\"0.278em\" /><mi>b</mi><mo>&#x02260;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>.  </li>\n<li>Triangle inequality: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mo>&#x02264;</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo></mrow></math>.  </li>\n</ol>\n<hr />\n\n<h3>Case 1: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></math></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&#x02265;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></math> or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></math>.  </li>\n<li>If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&#x0003C;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>: No solution.  </li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Example 1</strong><br />\nSolve <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></math>.  </p>\n<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>7</mn><mspace width=\"1em\" /><mtext>or</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\" /><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></math>\n\n<hr />\n<h3>Case 2: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></math></h3>\n<p>Split into two cases.  </p>\n<p><strong>Example 2</strong><br />\nSolve <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></math>.  </p>\n<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>5</mn><mspace width=\"1em\" /><mo>&#x021D2;</mo><mspace width=\"1em\" /><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></math>\n\n<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>5</mn><mspace width=\"1em\" /><mo>&#x021D2;</mo><mspace width=\"1em\" /><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></math>\n\n<hr />\n\n<ol>\n<li><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mo>&#x0003C;</mo><mi>a</mi><mspace width=\"0.278em\" /><mspace width=\"0.278em\" /><mo>&#x021D2;</mo><mspace width=\"0.278em\" /><mspace width=\"0.278em\" /><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#x0003C;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0003C;</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></math>  </li>\n<li><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mo>&#x02264;</mo><mi>a</mi><mspace width=\"0.278em\" /><mspace width=\"0.278em\" /><mo>&#x021D2;</mo><mspace width=\"0.278em\" /><mspace width=\"0.278em\" /><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#x02264;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x02264;</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></math>  </li>\n<li><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mo>&#x0003E;</mo><mi>a</mi><mspace width=\"0.278em\" /><mspace width=\"0.278em\" /><mo>&#x021D2;</mo><mspace width=\"0.278em\" /><mspace width=\"0.278em\" /><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0003C;</mo><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></math> or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0003E;</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></math>  </li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>Example 3</strong><br />\nSolve <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mo>&#x0003C;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></math>.  </p>\n<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#x0003C;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#x0003C;</mo><mn>3</mn><mspace width=\"1em\" /><mo>&#x021D2;</mo><mspace width=\"1em\" /><mn>1</mn><mo>&#x0003C;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0003C;</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></math>\n\n<p><strong>Example 4</strong><br />\nSolve <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mo>&#x02265;</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></math>.  </p>\n<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#x02265;</mo><mn>5</mn><mspace width=\"1em\" /><mo>&#x021D2;</mo><mspace width=\"1em\" /><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x02265;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></math>\n\n<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#x02264;</mo><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>5</mn><mspace width=\"1em\" /><mo>&#x021D2;</mo><mspace width=\"1em\" /><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x02264;</mo><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></math>\n\n<hr />\n\n<p>Distance is always nonnegative.  </p>\n<p><strong>Example 5</strong><br />\nA number is within 4 units of 10. Find the range of possible values.  </p>\n<p>Equation: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mo>&#x02264;</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></math>.  </p>\n<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>&#x02264;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x02264;</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow></math>\n\n<hr />\n\n<ul>\n<li>Always split into cases.  </li>\n<li>Check for <strong>no solutions</strong> when RHS is negative.  </li>\n<li>Graph inequalities on number line if unsure.  </li>\n<li>Remember: absolute value = distance.  </li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n\n<p>1) Solve <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></math>.<br />\n2) Solve <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>.<br />\n3) Solve <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mo>&#x02264;</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></math>.<br />\n4) Solve <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mo>&#x0003E;</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></math>.<br />\n5) A number is within 2 units of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></math>. Write inequality and solution set.  </p>\n<hr />\n\n<p>1) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></math> or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></math>.  </p>\n<p>2) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></math>.  </p>\n<p>3) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#x02264;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#x02264;</mo><mn>6</mn><mspace width=\"1em\" /><mo>&#x021D2;</mo><mspace width=\"1em\" /><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#x02264;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x02264;</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></math>.  </p>\n<p>4) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#x0003E;</mo><mn>10</mn><mspace width=\"1em\" /><mo>&#x021D2;</mo><mspace width=\"1em\" /><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0003E;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></math><br />\n   OR <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#x0003C;</mo><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>10</mn><mspace width=\"1em\" /><mo>&#x021D2;</mo><mspace width=\"1em\" /><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0003C;</mo><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>&#x0002F;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></math>.  </p>\n<p>5) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mo>&#x02264;</mo><mn>2</mn><mspace width=\"1em\" /><mo>&#x021D2;</mo><mspace width=\"1em\" /><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#x02264;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x02264;</mo><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></math>.  </p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-python\">\n</code></pre>",
